<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DompetKu - Beranda</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #111; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    nav { border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; }
    nav a { text-decoration: none; color: #2563eb; font-weight: 500; }
    nav a.active { color: #1d4ed8; }
    .card { border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px; padding: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; background: #fff; }
    .api-key-bar { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
    .api-key-bar code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; background: #fff; padding: 0.15rem 0.3rem; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; }
    .result { margin-top: 0.75rem; padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .result.ok { background: #dcfce7; color: #166534; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
    .result.err { background: #fee2e2; color: #991b1b; border: 1px solid #fecaca; }
    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    th, td { text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
    th { font-weight: 600; color: #374151; }
    .muted { color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav>
    <a href="/" class="active">Beranda</a>
    <a href="/register<%= api_key ? '?api_key=' + api_key : '' %>">Daftar</a>
    <a href="/balance<%= api_key ? '?api_key=' + api_key : '' %>">Cek Saldo</a>
    <a href="/topup<%= api_key ? '?api_key=' + api_key : '' %>">Top Up</a>
    <a href="/transfer<%= api_key ? '?api_key=' + api_key : '' %>">Transfer</a>
    <a href="/transactions<%= api_key ? '?api_key=' + api_key : '' %>">Riwayat</a>
  </nav>

  <h1>DompetKu</h1>
  <p>E-Wallet Kantin Kampus — Tubes 1 Komputasi Awan.</p>

  <% if (api_key) { %>
    <div class="api-key-bar">
      <strong>API Key Anda:</strong><br>
      <code><%- api_key %></code>
    </div>
    <p>Gunakan API key di atas untuk mengakses fitur saldo, top up, transfer, dan riwayat transaksi.</p>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Mulai</h2>
      <p>Daftar akun baru untuk mendapatkan API key, lalu gunakan untuk mencoba fitur e-wallet.</p>
      <a href="/register" style="display:inline-block; padding: 0.6rem 1rem; background: #2563eb; color: #fff; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;">Daftar Akun Baru</a>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Fitur</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Registrasi</strong> &rarr; dapatkan API key</li>
      <li><strong>Cek Saldo</strong> &rarr; lihat saldo terkini</li>
      <li><strong>Top Up</strong> &rarr; isi saldo (min Rp 1.000)</li>
      <li><strong>Transfer</strong> &rarr; kirim ke akun lain (min Rp 1.000, batas Rp 2.000.000/hari)</li>
      <li><strong>Riwayat</strong> &rarr; lihat semua transaksi</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
</html>